{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "ifm-cue-1",
      "transcript": "How can light reveal an obstacle without being absorbed or reflected by it?",
      "file": "audio/ifm/narration/cue-1.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 5.3,
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.1",
      "samples": 127200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-cue-2",
      "transcript": "Send one photon into an interferometer: two possible paths, joined again.",
      "file": "audio/ifm/narration/cue-2.wav",
      "start": 5.666666666666667,
      "duration": 5.525,
      "beatIndex": 1,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.2",
      "samples": 132600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-cue-3",
      "transcript": "With both paths open and the device correctly aligned, interference keeps one detector dark.",
      "file": "audio/ifm/narration/cue-3.wav",
      "start": 11.4,
      "duration": 6.425,
      "beatIndex": 2,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.3",
      "samples": 154200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-cue-4",
      "transcript": "The waves associated with the two paths cancel at that output.",
      "file": "audio/ifm/narration/cue-4.wav",
      "start": 18.033333333333335,
      "duration": 4.375,
      "beatIndex": 3,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.4",
      "samples": 105000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-cue-5",
      "transcript": "Now put a light-absorbing object in one path. If it absorbs the photon, neither output detector clicks.",
      "file": "audio/ifm/narration/cue-5.wav",
      "start": 22.633333333333333,
      "duration": 7.4,
      "beatIndex": 4,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.5",
      "samples": 177600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-cue-6",
      "transcript": "But sometimes the formerly dark detector clicks instead.",
      "file": "audio/ifm/narration/cue-6.wav",
      "start": 30.233333333333334,
      "duration": 4,
      "beatIndex": 5,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.6",
      "samples": 96000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-cue-7",
      "transcript": "That single photon reached the detector, so the object did not absorb it. The blocked path removed the cancellation.",
      "file": "audio/ifm/narration/cue-7.wav",
      "start": 34.6,
      "duration": 7.9,
      "beatIndex": 6,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.7",
      "samples": 189600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-cue-8",
      "transcript": "The click reveals the obstacle. Other trials absorb the photon or give no clear answer. This is not a guaranteed harmless test.",
      "file": "audio/ifm/narration/cue-8.wav",
      "start": 42.7,
      "duration": 9.55,
      "beatIndex": 7,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.8",
      "samples": 229200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-cue-9",
      "transcript": "Researchers have demonstrated this effect, called interaction-free measurement. The clue comes from changing which paths are available.",
      "file": "audio/ifm/narration/cue-9.wav",
      "start": 52.46666666666667,
      "duration": 8.375,
      "beatIndex": 8,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.9",
      "samples": 201000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    }
  ],
